        <item>
            <title>0.73</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 06:17:42 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1790748624</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.73</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added Cursor, Grok, and Antigravity as CLI backends, with sign-in, model discovery, update checks, and streaming chat support for each.</li>
<li>Chat messages can now link to other conversations. Linked conversations appear as clickable cards, and agents can create these links through new tools.</li>
<li>Conversation search now looks inside conversation content, not just titles.</li>
<li>Permission requests now send a notification, including a push to Addy Mobile. The request card also shows how long it has been waiting.</li>
<li>Addy Mobile&#x27;s browser pane can show a phone-sized page with an iPhone user agent, rendered on the Mac beside the desktop view. Tapping a text field now reports back whether the page has a field focused.</li>
<li>Chat now has a new animated Addy logo for the restore screen.</li>
<li>Added a strip of pane tabs to the split-pane layout, with new layout handling in the split pane view.</li>
<li>Markdown blockquotes in chat now draw a continuous rounded bar beside the quoted text, including across wrapped lines.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Settings has been substantially reworked, with a new layout and rows. Theme selection is now done in Settings and the Theme editor, with a new theme snapshot preview.</li>
<li>Signed-out CLIs now show a single sign-in card instead of repeated errors. The card spans the chat column with more padding, and the stall toast is quieter.</li>
<li>Agents can no longer switch the project you are looking at. Their requests to change the visible project are refused.</li>
<li>Chat activity cards stay full width when they show pane buttons, instead of shrinking to the button&#x27;s title.</li>
<li>The Addy app icon and dev icon have been refreshed, and 1024px iOS icon exports were added.</li>
<li>Chat timestamps now have consistent margins, and user message rows use the same spacing as assistant rows.</li>
<li>Chat scrolling now follows new content more reliably.</li>
<li>Updated the bundled model catalog and theme defaults.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed a deadlock between iCloud sync and the main thread that could freeze the app.</li>
<li>Fixed a crash when a backend reused a message ID across turns and appended blocks out of order.</li>
<li>The auto-compaction setting is now reset to off once if it was left on from an earlier version.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Internal Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Removed the Gemini CLI backend, its stream parser, and its terminal conversation adapter.</li>
<li>Release builds are about 9 minutes faster, release-note formatting was fixed, and old update archives are now pruned from the update feed on every release.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
